<title>UK: Banco Mayo sets $50 million two-year bond.</title>
<headline>Banco Mayo sets $50 million two-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Paribas.</p>
<p> BORROWER   BANCO MAYO</p>
<p> AMT    $50 MLN	 COUPON     9.125     MATURITY    30.JUN.99</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  100.97    PAY DATE    30.JUN.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  2.0	 REOFFER    99.97     SPREAD	+310 BP</p>
<p> SALE LIMITS US/UK/AR LISTING    LUX/BA    PAY FREQ    SEMI-ANN</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   IPMA 2</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  ARGENTINA TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.5	 SELL CONC  1.5	 PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p> NOTES	ISSUED UNDER EMTN PROGRAMME</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
